dist-ssr
*.local

# E2E target environments. .env.local and .env.verita-dev are committed on purpose: the hosts are
# public and SEED_PASSWORD is the seed script's own fixture password, not a credential. Only the
# Azure VM's file is ignored, because its public IP is assigned per deploy.
tests/e2e/.env.azure
# Vite's `*.local` above is meant for local secrets and would otherwise swallow this one.
!tests/e2e/.env.local

